<item><title>Maersk plans full Suez Canal service return by March 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/maersk-plans-full-suez-canal-service-return-by-march-2027-74c1a8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/maersk-plans-full-suez-canal-service-return-by-march-2027-74c1a8/</guid><category>Egypt</category><description>The carrier has resumed canal and Red Sea operations, while its CEO says the rest of its network will return over coming months.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:18:09 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/maersk-plans-full-suez-canal-service-return-by-march-2027-74c1a8/share.jpg" length="42723" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/maersk-plans-full-suez-canal-service-return-by-march-2027-74c1a8/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
